# Append-biased union merge for memory topic files: on a rebase/merge conflict,
# keep BOTH sides instead of picking one — memory loss is worse than duplication,
# and de-duplication is the MEMORY.md index's job, not git's. Driver command is
# registered locally by scripts/memory-sync.sh (git does not trust driver commands
# from a cloned .gitattributes for arbitrary-code-execution reasons).
*.md merge=mdunion
